{"seq":1,"slug":"intercompany-loan-capitalization","title":"多实体内部借贷与资本弱化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/intercompany-funding-transfer/intercompany-loan-capitalization","wordCount":2107,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"多实体内部借贷与资本弱化\">多实体内部借贷与资本弱化</h1><p>资金归集在合并层面看只是把钱从左手挪到右手，但在<strong>单个法人</strong>的报表上看，每一次归集都是一笔真实的关联方借贷。这个转化的后果是：集团越依赖内部融资，成员账上的关联方债务越大，而各国税法对&quot;用债务融资替代股权融资以获取利息税前扣除&quot;恰恰有系统性限制。资本弱化（thin capitalization）规则就是这道限制的具体形式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>母公司给子公司注资有两种方式：出资（equity）和借款（debt）。两者在税务上待遇完全不同——出资的回报（股息）通常不能税前扣除，借款的回报（利息）通常可以。如果子公司所在国税率高、母公司所在国税率低，用借款替代出资可以把利润以利息形式从高税国转到低税国，同时在高税国获得扣除。资本弱化规则的目标就是<strong>限制这种由债务结构带来的税基侵蚀</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[母公司] --&gt;|股权出资| B[高税国子公司]&#10;    A --&gt;|内部借款| B&#10;    B --&gt; C[利息支出 可税前扣除]&#10;    B --&gt; D[股息分配 不可税前扣除]&#10;    C --&gt; E{是否超过扣除限额}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[全额扣除]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[超限部分不得扣除 或 递延]&#10;    G --&gt; H[固定比率法 基于EBITDA]&#10;    G --&gt; I[固定债务权益比法]\">graph TD\n    A[母公司] --&gt;|股权出资| B[高税国子公司]\n    A --&gt;|内部借款| B\n    B --&gt; C[利息支出 可税前扣除]\n    B --&gt; D[股息分配 不可税前扣除]\n    C --&gt; E{是否超过扣除限额}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[全额扣除]\n    E --&gt;|是| G[超限部分不得扣除 或 递延]\n    G --&gt; H[固定比率法 基于EBITDA]\n    G --&gt; I[固定债务权益比法]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则类型</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>代表地区</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定债务权益比</td>\n<td>债务/权益 ≤ 阈值</td>\n<td>部分新兴市场</td>\n<td>直观，但受会计口径影响大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定比率法（EBITDA）</td>\n<td>净利息 ≤ EBITDA 的固定比例</td>\n<td>欧盟 ATAD、OECD 建议</td>\n<td>与盈利能力挂钩，经济意义更强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集团比率法</td>\n<td>参照集团整体净利息/EBITDA</td>\n<td>OECD 建议的可选补充</td>\n<td>避免对高杠杆集团过度限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立交易原则</td>\n<td>与第三方可比利率</td>\n<td>转让定价规则</td>\n<td>管价格而非管规模</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ebitda-固定比率法的机制\">EBITDA 固定比率法的机制</h2><p>OECD 在 BEPS 第 4 项行动计划中推荐以<strong>固定比率法</strong>为基础：以 EBITDA 的一个固定百分比作为净利息扣除上限，并给出一个可供各国选择的区间，同时以集团比率法作为可选补充。欧盟《反避税指令》将这一方法落为具体的法律条款，其核心结构是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可扣除净利息</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>调整后税前 EBITDA</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> de minimis 门槛</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可扣除净利息} \\leq \\max\\left(30\\% \\times \\text{调整后税前 EBITDA},\\ \\text{de minimis 门槛}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可扣除净利息</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">调整后税前</span><span class=\"mord\"> EBITDA</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">de minimis </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">门槛</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>据 Council Directive (EU) 2016/1164 第 4 条，超额借款成本&quot;仅在不超过纳税人息税折旧摊销前利润（EBITDA）的 <strong>30%</strong> 的范围内可扣除&quot;；第 4(3) 条另给两条豁免：纳税人可扣除&quot;不超过 <strong>EUR 3 000 000</strong> 的超额借款成本&quot;，以及<strong>独立实体</strong>（不属于财务合并集团、且无关联企业或常设机构）可全额扣除。第 4(5) 条提供<strong>集团逃逸条款</strong>两条路径：其权益/资产比率不低于集团比率（允许低至两个百分点以内视为相当），或按集团比率法计算——以集团对第三方的超额借款成本除以集团 EBITDA 得到集团比率，再乘以该纳税人的 EBITDA 得出可扣除上限（见 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:32016L1164&amp;from=EN\">Directive (EU) 2016/1164 第 4 条官方文本</a>）。</p>\n<p>对司库的含义有两条。第一，<strong>内部借贷的规模不能只由资金需求决定</strong>，必须与各成员的 EBITDA 挂钩核算可扣除空间。第二，EBITDA 而非利润作为基数，意味着折旧摊销大的重资产成员有更大的扣除空间，而盈利波动大的成员空间不稳定——同一笔内部借款在不同成员处的实际税后成本不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"税后成本的正确算法\">税后成本的正确算法</h3><p>内部借款的税后成本不是利率本身：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>after-tax</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>deductible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r*{\\text{after-tax}} = r \\times (1 - t*{\\text{deductible}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">after-tax</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deductible</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>deductible</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{deductible}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deductible</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该成员实际可扣除的比例。当利息超限时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>deductible</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{deductible}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deductible</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为零，税后成本等于税前成本；当未超限时，税后成本被税率打折。因此<strong>用同一利率给所有成员定价，在税后视角下并不公平</strong>，这也是<a href=\"fund-transfer-pricing-interest\">内部资金转移定价（FTP）与利息</a>需要考虑税务维度而非仅考虑资金成本的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内部借贷的形式选择\">内部借贷的形式选择</h2><p>同样是&quot;把钱给子公司用&quot;，法律形式不同，税务与合规后果差别很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>法律性质</th>\n<th>利息扣除</th>\n<th>主要约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接股东贷款</td>\n<td>债权</td>\n<td>通常可扣除</td>\n<td>资本弱化、转让定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背对背贷款</td>\n<td>债权（银行通道）</td>\n<td>可扣除</td>\n<td>通道成本、反避税审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现金池内透支</td>\n<td>债权（协议约定）</td>\n<td>视协议而定</td>\n<td>需明确利率与期限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增资</td>\n<td>股权</td>\n<td>不可扣除</td>\n<td>审批、外汇登记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合工具</td>\n<td>债/股之间</td>\n<td>视税法定性</td>\n<td>定性风险高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现金池内的透支是最容易被忽略的一种。资金池协议下成员的净头寸是浮动的，谁欠谁、欠多久由每日头寸决定。如果协议没有明确利率、期限与结算机制，这些浮动往来在税务上可能被视为<strong>无息关联方往来</strong>，进而被税务机关按独立交易原则核定利息收入——既补了税又罚了款。因此资金池协议必须写明内部计息规则，并且该规则要与 FTP 曲线一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资金池与额度集中的交互\">资金池与额度集中的交互</h2><p>跨境资金池的外债与境外放款额度（见<a href=\"../cash-pool-structure/crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory\">跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束</a>）在税务上不是中性安排。额度内集中的外债，在成员账上仍然是一笔外债；主办企业作为实际借款人或代理人借入，成员之间形成内部债权债务。这产生两个必须处理的问题：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，额度占用是集中的，但债务人是分散的。</strong> 主办企业借入外债后转贷给成员，转贷构成第二层内部借贷，需要单独评估各成员的资本弱化空间。<strong>第二，资金用途受双重限制。</strong> 监管要求境外放款资金用途合法、不得直接或间接用于借款人经营范围之外支出、不得进行跨币种套利；税法要求利息定价符合独立交易原则。两条约束同时作用于同一笔资金，任何一方的调整都可能影响另一方的合规性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  e.entity_code,&#10;  e.jurisdiction,&#10;  e.ebitda_adj,&#10;  e.tax_rate,&#10;  COALESCE(d.net_interest_expense, 0)                        AS net_interest,&#10;  ROUND(e.ebitda_adj * 0.30, 2)                              AS ebitda_cap,&#10;  ROUND(GREATEST(e.ebitda_adj * 0.30 - COALESCE(d.net_interest_expense, 0), 0), 2)&#10;                                                             AS headroom,&#10;  ROUND(COALESCE(d.net_interest_expense, 0)&#10;        / NULLIF(e.ebitda_adj, 0), 4)                        AS interest_ratio&#10;FROM entity_tax_profile e&#10;LEFT JOIN (&#10;  SELECT entity_code, SUM(amount) AS net_interest_expense&#10;  FROM intercompany_interest&#10;  WHERE fiscal_year = 2026 AND direction = &#39;expense&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY entity_code&#10;) d ON d.entity_code = e.entity_code&#10;ORDER BY headroom ASC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">jurisdiction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ebitda_adj</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tax_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_interest_expense</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_interest,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ebitda_adj</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ebitda_cap,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ebitda_adj</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_interest_expense</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                             AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headroom,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">net_interest_expense</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ebitda_adj</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interest_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_tax_profile e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_code, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_interest_expense</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intercompany_interest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fiscal_year </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2026</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expense'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headroom </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>headroom</code> 是新增内部借款的税务空间，<code>interest_ratio</code> 用于判断是否触发集团逃逸条款的比较。这张表应作为内部借贷定价与额度分配的前置检查，而不是事后核算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转让定价的并行约束\">转让定价的并行约束</h2><p>资本弱化管<strong>规模</strong>，转让定价管<strong>价格</strong>。两条规则并行作用：一笔内部借款即使规模在 EBITDA 限额内全额可扣除，利率若偏离独立交易水平，仍会被调整。判断内部利率是否合理，通常使用可比非受控价格法——参考同类主体在同币种、同期限、同信用条件下从第三方可获得的利率，或参考集团实际对外融资成本加合理利差。</p>\n<p>内部利率不能低于该成员自身的对外融资成本，也不能高于集团对外融资成本太多。资金池场景下的常见做法是以集团加权平均资金成本（WACF）为基准加减利差，具体机制见<a href=\"fund-transfer-pricing-interest\">内部资金转移定价（FTP）与利息</a>。这一整套安排的审计防御逻辑与 <a href=\"../transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/\">149 转让定价税务审计防御</a>处理的是同一个问题域，本 hub 只取其与内部借贷定价直接相关的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内部借贷在合并层面抵销，在单法人层面是真实关联方债务，因此必须处理资本弱化与转让定价。</li>\n<li>EBITDA 固定比率法的典型形式是净利息扣除上限为 EBITDA 的 30%，配低额豁免门槛、独立实体豁免与集团逃逸条款。</li>\n<li>可扣除空间与成员 EBITDA 挂钩，同一利率在不同成员处的税后成本不同。</li>\n<li>内部借款形式（股东贷款、背对背、池内透支、增资）在扣除资格与合规路径上差异很大。</li>\n<li>现金池内透支若无明确利率与期限约定，可能被核定为无息关联方往来并补税。</li>\n<li>额度集中的外债在成员账上是真实外债，转贷构成第二层内部借贷，需单独评估扣除空间。</li>\n<li>资本弱化管规模、转让定价管价格，两条规则并行不可互相替代。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多实体内部借贷与资本弱化","id":"多实体内部借贷与资本弱化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"EBITDA 固定比率法的机制","id":"ebitda-固定比率法的机制"},{"level":3,"text":"税后成本的正确算法","id":"税后成本的正确算法"},{"level":2,"text":"内部借贷的形式选择","id":"内部借贷的形式选择"},{"level":2,"text":"资金池与额度集中的交互","id":"资金池与额度集中的交互"},{"level":2,"text":"转让定价的并行约束","id":"转让定价的并行约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"短期投资与闲置资金收益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/position-netting-liquidity/shortterm-investment-yield"},"next":{"title":"内部资金转移定价（FTP）与利息","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/intercompany-funding-transfer/fund-transfer-pricing-interest"}}